WEBVTT

00:00:08.856 --> 00:00:09.509
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> Hello?

00:00:11.002 --> 00:00:11.560
Hello?

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:13.440
Can you hear me?

00:00:18.259 --> 00:00:18.980
Sorry?

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:20.333
You’re on mute.

00:00:26.878 --> 00:00:28.220
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> Is it OK now?

00:00:28.499 --> 00:00:30.037
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> Yes, fine now!

00:00:30.742 --> 00:00:34.242
Hello, I’m Harry, from English House Language School.

00:00:35.009 --> 00:00:36.264
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> Hi, Harry.

00:00:36.872 --> 00:00:37.440
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> Hi, there.

00:00:38.274 --> 00:00:41.334
