00:00:45.774 --> 00:00:47.160
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> What’s your first name?

00:00:48.194 --> 00:00:49.241
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> Micaela.

00:00:50.988 --> 00:00:51.895
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> How do you spell it?

00:00:53.317 --> 00:00:57.632
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> M-I-C-A-E-L-A.

00:01:00.237 --> 00:01:05.399
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> M-I-C-A-E-L-A – is that right?

00:01:06.103 --> 00:01:07.476
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> Yes, that’s right.

00:01:08.838 --> 00:01:11.215
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> And … what’s your last name?

00:01:12.101 --> 00:01:13.088
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> Vazquez.

00:01:16.251 --> 00:01:19.702
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> Vazquez. Is that V-A-S…?

00:01:19.726 --> 00:01:27.639
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> No, it’s V-A-Z-Q-U-E-Z

00:01:30.169 --> 00:01:35.670
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> V-A-Z-Q-U-E-Z.

00:01:37.343 --> 00:01:40.389
OK. Uh, how old are you, Micaela?

00:01:41.314 --> 00:01:42.515
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> I’m 25.

00:01:45.216 --> 00:01:46.331
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> Where are you from?

00:01:47.078 --> 00:01:48.566
