00:02:20.385 --> 00:02:21.385
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> Sorry?

00:02:22.985 --> 00:02:24.835
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> You know, the zip code.

00:02:26.628 --> 00:02:27.760
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> Ah yes.

00:02:27.761 --> 00:02:34.461
It’s C-1-0-0-5-A-A-C.

00:02:36.922 --> 00:02:41.867
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> C-1-0-0-5-A-A-C.

00:02:42.749 --> 00:02:43.209
